      "detail": "Roof vents, door bays and waistband now read, but daylight glass remains opaque gray and paint flat. Body roughness0.56 exceeds the specified0.25\u20130.45. Night windows share one pale treatment rather than at least two warm/cool tints and one dark window. Add restrained glass/interior depth and deterministic individual variation while preserving the corrected movement and draw budget. The pinned bus crop has maximum8-neighbour excess184.84045/255 and3069pixels>40; it includes edges/background/HUD, so this is a literal crop failure, not proof that all bright pixels are paint sparkle.",
